Theorem IC-1: Six contract record types — MemoryContract + ParamContract + ReturnContract + EffectSummary + FipContract + ContextBehavior

  Preconditions:
    - Contract records are the interprocedural summary domain for AIMS
      per Annex E §AIMS + arc.md sec-Key-Types
    - MemoryContract is the top-level per-function summary
    - ParamContract is per-parameter access / consumption / usage state
    - ReturnContract is per-function return-value state
    - EffectSummary is per-function memory-effect classification
    - FipContract is the FIP certification tier per IC-6
    - ContextBehavior is the TRMC context-region annotation per PL-11
    - Record field types reference the per-dimension lattices authored
      at aims-proof/proofs/01-lattice/Lattice.proof + the sentinels
      authored at aims-proof/proofs/01-lattice/Product.proof

  Soundness property:
    MemoryContract record (5 fields per PL-11 + the canonical proof notation:89-96):

      MemoryContract = <
        params: List ParamContract,
        ret: ReturnContract,
        effects: EffectSummary,
        fip: FipContract,
        context: ContextBehavior
      >

      Closes opencode S01-R0-F4 MemoryContract-context-missing finding:
        the 5th field `context: ContextBehavior` is REQUIRED; the legacy
        4-field shape (omitting context) is rejected.

    ParamContract record (6 fields per IC-3 + the canonical proof notation:99-110):

      ParamContract = <
        access: Access,
        consumption: Consumption,
        cardinality: Cardinality,
        locality: Locality,
        uniqueness: Uniqueness,
        may_share: Bool
      >

      Initialization per IC-2: most-optimistic (B, empty, absent, bl, u, false);
      Fixpoint per IC-3: componentwise max + may_share OR; iterate until
      no dim changes;
      Convergence bound: included in IC-7 derived limit.

    ReturnContract record (4 fields per IC-4 + sec-1.9):

      ReturnContract = <
        uniqueness: Uniqueness,
        preserves_freshness: Bool,
        locality: Locality,
        shape: Shape
      >

      Join over return paths: uniqueness(join), preserves_freshness(AND),
        locality(join), shape(join).
      Extracted by structural definition tracing per Annex E §AIMS.9
      Return Provenance table.

    EffectSummary record (7 fields per IC-5):

      EffectSummary = <
        may_allocate: Bool,
        may_deallocate: Bool,
        may_share: Bool,
        may_throw: Bool,
        has_unbounded_stack: Bool,
        may_read_inaccessible: Bool,
        alloc_only_on_slow_path: Bool
      >

      Derivation per Annex E §AIMS IC-5: scan instruction stream + callee
      contracts (NOT per-variable EffectClass joined componentwise — see
      Annex E §AIMS.7 CRITICAL note + Effect.proof reconciliation).

    FipContract sum type (per IC-6):

      FipContract = Never | Bounded(n: Int) | Conditional | Certified

      Join semantics per IC-6: Never absorbs all; Conditional absorbs
      Bounded / Certified; Bounded(n) join Bounded(m) = Bounded(max(n, m));
      Certified IFF zero unmatched alloc / dealloc in realized IR.
      Timing: POST-REALIZATION (step 5a). Step 1 inits Never.

    ContextBehavior record (4 Bool fields per PL-11 + the canonical proof notation:146-152):

      ContextBehavior = <
        preserves_context: Bool,
        consumes_hole: Bool,
        requires_unique_context: Bool,
        may_resume_nonlinearly: Bool
      >

      Initialization: most-optimistic <true, true, false, false>;
      Join: preserves_context(AND), consumes_hole(AND),
        requires_unique_context(OR), may_resume_nonlinearly(OR).
      Derived from TRMC context-region detection per PL-7 / PL-8 / PL-9.

  Proof obligation:
    sorry -- discharged by sec-06 (IC-1 through IC-7 interprocedural contract
            proofs) + sec-07 (PL-11 ContextBehavior derivation proofs)

    Engines dispatched:
      fixpoint (validates IC-3 + IC-4 + IC-5 + IC-6 + PL-11 monotone fixpoint
                convergence)
      interprocedural_summary (validates contract-record SCC topological
                               ordering + per-function summary computation)
      case_analysis (validates FipContract sum-type 4-tier ordering +
                     per-field joins)

  Expected:
    status: unimplemented_engine_shape
    reason: sec-01 skeleton; sec-06 + sec-07 discharge contract record proofs
